                                                "sense_id": "225b93ef-2fe1-330f-a56a-11ce37bdf7e5",
                                                "text": "They had their lists of Liberals and of the doubtfuls who still remained doubtful. As the election drew near, the force of the whole organization was turned upon these unrepentant doubtfuls."
